格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH web shell mobile adapter plugin: overlay sidebar/details drawers, responsive composer and settings below 768px, zero desktop regression. DSH Web 移动端适配插件:抽屉浮层化、输入栏与设置页响应式适配,桌面零回归。","id":"gh:1335708690","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-mobile","slug":"TecFancy/dsh-mobile","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","mobile","plugin","responsive","web"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH web shell mobile adapter plugin: overlay sidebar/details drawers, responsive composer and settin"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"gs below 768px, zero desktop regression. DSH Web 移动端适配插件:抽屉浮层化、输入栏与设置页响应式适配,桌面零回归。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-mobile"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**A mobile adapter for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) web shell.** The stock\nshell is desktop-first: bel"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ow 1024px the sidebar only collapses to a rail, and\non phones the expanded drawer squeezes the main "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"column to ~110px, composer\nbuttons overlap, and the settings dialog shrinks to a sliver. `dsh-mobile"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"`\nadds the missing phone tier (< 768px) as a client plugin — no shell fork, no\ndesktop changes."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Overlay sidebar drawer** — opening the sidebar on a phone floats it over\nthe content with a scri"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"m instead of squeezing the main column to 110px;\ntapping outside closes it.\n- **Overlay details pane"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"l** — the tool-details panel opens as a right-side\noverlay and never squeezes the conversation.\n- **"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"Non-overlapping composer** — the mode buttons and the model selector wrap\nonto separate rows instead"},{"id":"p6s5","text":" of covering each other.\n- **Re-flowed settings dialog** — the dialog stacks vertically with a\nhoriz"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"ontally scrollable tab bar; the content column gets full width.\n- **Zero desktop regression** — ever"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"y rule hangs under a narrow-viewport\nmarker; viewports ≥ 1024px behave exactly like the stock shell."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Verified on Ubuntu 24.04 (x86_64) with DSH `0.1.0-rc.6`, iPhone-15 viewport\n(390×844). Screenshots s"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"24.04 (x86_64) with DSH `0.1.0-rc.6`, iPhone-15 viewport\n(390×844). Screenshots show the English UI."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**New-session screen on a phone** (hero + composer with a workspace\nselected, laid out for the narro"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"n screen on a phone** (hero + composer with a workspace\nselected, laid out for the narrow viewport):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Sidebar drawer: before (stock shell) vs after**"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Before — content squeezed to 110px              | After — overlay drawer + scrim                |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Settings dialog on a phone** (vertical layout, full-width content):"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Desktop ≥ 1024px — untouched**:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Requires Node ≥ 22 and a DSH installation (`dsh` CLI). Install into your\nprofile and restart `dsh we"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"uires Node ≥ 22 and a DSH installation (`dsh` CLI). Install into your\nprofile and restart `dsh web`:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"> Note: if your npm registry is a mirror (e.g. `registry.npmmirror.com`),\n> brand-new packages can l"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ag behind the official registry for a while —\n> add `--registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/` if the "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"install reports 404."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The plugin activates automatically on narrow viewports (< 768px) and stays\ninert on desktop. Removin"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"g it is one command: `dsh plugin --profile web remove\n@tecfancy/dsh-mobile`."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- A JS breakpoint layer marks narrow viewports as `body[data-dsh-mobile]`.\n- A state bridge mirrors "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"the shell's layout state onto `body[data-dsh-drawer]`\n/ `body[data-dsh-details]`.\n- A stylesheet (an"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"chored on the shell's stable `[data-slot]` hooks) turns the\nsidebar/details columns into fixed overl"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ays on phones, re-flows the\ncomposer and the settings dialog, and never runs outside the mobile tier"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"ys on phones, re-flows the\ncomposer and the settings dialog, and never runs outside the mobile tier."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"No shell source is modified, no server component is required, and the plugin\ncoexists with other she"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ll-level plugins (verified with `dsh-better-sidebar`)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- DSH `0.1.0-rc.6` (tested on macOS and Ubuntu 24.04; full viewport matrix:\n360 / 390 / 430 / 768 / "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"1440).\n- The 768–1023px tablet range keeps the stock shell behavior (by design).\n- `prefers-reduced-"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"23px tablet range keeps the stock shell behavior (by design).\n- `prefers-reduced-motion` is honored."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
